---
/**
 * Ad submission — the page that makes FODEL money.
 *
 * Launch round: registration first, the listing after. This page used to ask
 * for everything at once — package, extras, a live total, the property, the
 * description and the billing details — and then created only an invite, so
 * nothing reached the admin until the emailed link was accepted. Now it asks
 * for a name, an email address and a phone number (RegisterForm.astro); the
 * package, the property and the photos are chosen step by step in the
 * portal's guided setup (src/pages/portal/properties/[id]/setup.astro), and
 * the registration shows up in the admin inbox the moment it is made.
 *
 * The packages stay on the page as information — real catalogue prices from
 * listingCatalog()/packageCard(), the recommended one badged — so nobody has
 * to register to find out what it costs. The €179 tier is still decided
 * server-side from the listing's own forint price (isAboveThreshold()).
 */
